{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "provenance": "Assistant-curated bilingual synthetic regression corpus, not human-labeled production traffic or a general semantic-quality benchmark.",
  "documents": [
    {
      "path": "fixtures/run_lease.md",
      "content": "run_lease owns a renewable execution lease. Lease expiry permits crash recovery; concurrent workers are rejected. 执行租约防止并发恢复。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/execute_operation.md",
      "content": "execute_operation journals tool results. An uncertain side effect blocks automatic replay until operator reconciliation. 不确定副作用需要人工核对。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/SqliteSaver.md",
      "content": "SqliteSaver persists graph checkpoints to disk across process restarts. sync durability saves graph progress before advancing. 持久化检查点。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/interrupt.md",
      "content": "interrupt suspends a human review node. Command resume supplies an approval decision without rerunning completed predecessors. 人工审核中断。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/IdentityStore.md",
      "content": "IdentityStore hashes generated bearer tokens using SHA256. Credentials resolve a server-owned actor and role. 身份不能由请求头自行声明。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/authorize_scope.md",
      "content": "authorize_scope checks owner identity and stored team membership. A team editor cannot confirm team governance records. 项目权限校验。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/lexical_recall.md",
      "content": "lexical_recall uses a PostgreSQL full-text GIN index and websearch_to_tsquery. This branch independently finds exact identifiers. 独立词法召回。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/vector_recall.md",
      "content": "vector_recall orders pgvector cosine distances. Access-control predicates run before LIMIT so inaccessible candidates do not consume the shortlist. 向量候选权限前置。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/chunk_markdown.md",
      "content": "chunk_markdown preserves heading paths and links child chunks to parent context. Markdown section boundaries improve source navigation. Markdown 分段。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/content_hash.md",
      "content": "content_hash detects unchanged documents during ingestion. Changed files create a new document version without rebuilding unchanged inputs. 增量入库。",
      "acl": [
        "alice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/retry_policy.md",
      "content": "retry_policy bounds transient TimeoutError and ConnectionError retries. PermissionError and validation failures are not retried. 有限重试。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/price_outbox.md",
      "content": "price_outbox records a pending price event in the same database transaction as its snapshot. Broker outages leave work for periodic compensation. 事务消息。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/snapshot_receipt.md",
      "content": "snapshot_receipt has a composite unique key of snapshot_id and monitor_id. Concurrent duplicate deliveries produce only one price check. 价格事件幂等。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/eligible_snapshot.md",
      "content": "eligible_snapshot checks SKU, owner, confirmation, region and membership. Pending price anomalies cannot trigger notifications. 价格证据筛选。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/render_explanations.md",
      "content": "render_explanations accepts candidate indexes and evidence IDs in an exact JSON schema. Unknown fields and ungrounded prose are rejected. 解释证据校验。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/publisher_confirm.md",
      "content": "publisher_confirm waits for broker acceptance before acknowledging the original retry event. Consumer acknowledgements are a separate guarantee. 消息确认。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/notification_lease.md",
      "content": "notification_lease claims a durable delivery job until its lease expires. Failed external delivery can be retried while the in-app record remains durable. 通知投递租约。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/RRF.md",
      "content": "RRF fuses ranked lexical and semantic candidates. Recall@K and MRR evaluate coverage and the first relevant result position. 检索排名融合。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/no_answer.md",
      "content": "no_answer abstains when neither lexical overlap nor semantic evidence clears the relevance threshold. Empty input is not a request to dump documents. 无答案拒答。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "fixtures/reconciliation_audit.md",
      "content": "reconciliation_audit records an operator, verified outcome and reason for an uncertain operation. Completed receipts can be supplied to avoid repeating the external action. 核对审计。",
      "acl": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
